  "content": "<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>为 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/spartan-weaponry\" rel=\"nofollow\">斯巴达武器</a> 添加了以 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/simpleores\" rel=\"nofollow\">SimpleOres</a> 为主题的武器。</strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>部分基于 CheezedFish 为 1.12.2 版本制作的 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/spartan-compatibility\" rel=\"nofollow\">斯巴达兼容性</a> 模组。</strong></span>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://lh5.googleusercontent.com/KTGh5Ky9WdZTZTBkDWFAiTaq_uUvs3kwxVr6NuL1DPsYirfmyRt5vvT93RIDyNTMfvU=w2400\" width=\"1536\" height=\"450\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>支持的材质：</strong></span></p><ul>\n<li style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>秘银</strong></span></li>\n<li style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>精金</strong></span></li>\n<li style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>黑曜石</strong></span></li>\n<li style=\"padding-left:30px\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"color:#0f0\"><strong>烈焰</strong> </span>（远程）—— 发射燃烧弹</span></li>\n</ul><p>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>计划更新：</strong></span></p><ul>\n<li style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">修复任何 <a href=\"https://github.com/KreloX/SpartanSimpleOres/issues?q=is:open is:issue label:bug\" rel=\"nofollow\">漏洞</a></span></li>\n</ul><p>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252ftinyurl.com%252fkreloxkinetic\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://1drv.ms/i/c/6bf544900f9867ae/IQR3yxNMtle9S4RxniPeeGgMAVrcnQ4U65DGA1uiSdBUIbE?width=837&amp;height=80&amp;n=-1\" width=\"837\" height=\"80\"> </a></p>",
